{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Moshe set up the Mishkan.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory expounded in the chapter Shetei HaLehem: one elevates in holiness and does not diminish. 'One elevates in holiness' — from where? From the firepans of Korah's assembly, which were made a plating for the altar. And 'one does not diminish' — from this verse: ״ויקם משה את המשכן״ — 'and Moshe set up the Mishkan' — ״ויקם את אדניו״, for see how many times in a day Moshe would set them up and take them apart, yet Scripture never explicitly says in any place ״ויורד משה את המשכן״, but only ״ויקם״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:08:04.975591827Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}